Bundled assets (not code)
-------------------------
Fonts, sound effects, motion-style templates and their previews live under
`app/public/`. Their origin and terms are recorded in `app/public/ASSETS.md`.
The twenty motion-style previews are regenerated from this repository's own
templates by `app/scripts/make-motion-previews.mjs`, so their provenance is
reproducible rather than asserted.

